# Help walkthrough voice

Strategy: [docs/GUIDE-help-and-tests.md](docs/GUIDE-help-and-tests.md). Help is for someone who just opened the app. They do not know we have tests.

- Write as if you are sitting with them on one project.
- Contents groups, in order: Overview, Setup, Journeys, Topics. There is no Overview / screen-map article. Do not add a third tour of the same shots. Screen jumps (`library`, `director`, `editor`) land on Getting started headings.
- Overview is Getting started, Sync, Folders, Projects. Getting started is first-run only: sign in, Library, New project, Director, Editor. It does not teach Sync newest, folder types, or delete project.
- Sync, Projects, and Folders are the reference pages for those jobs. Do not repeat those procedures on Getting started.
- Sync also explains this computer versus the cloud (Library / project stay here; Parascene Creations live on the account). There is no separate remote-vs-local article. Projects / Folders / Settings link to Sync; they do not reteach the model.
- Journeys are the generate sittings: Generate an image → Generate a video with audio. Each page finishes its own step.
- Generate speech and music is a sibling sitting (own project, one Flash line + a spoken file on A2). Do not splice it into the goblin → Audio to Video chain. Both use the in-app audio icon. The Flash tile is labeled FLASH; the disk file is the plain tile.
- Do not hand-wave mid-page to another article for a piece of this step. Put the prompt, the filled-in UI, and the result right here.
- Point forward only at the end, under **Where to go from here**. That is the next page in the chain.
- The same project and the same still continue downstream. Generate's goblin is Audio to Video's start frame. Do not show a second character.
- Image models is a Topics page: one prompt, then the still from every Text to Image model. No app screenshots. Grok sits with the other frontier stills; its tile is the Generate still.
- Video models is a Topics page: Models vs Intents at the top, then a brand bar per family (Wan, LTX, MiniMax H3), then the five intents. No app screenshots. No integration test yet.
- Audio models is a Topics page: intents first (Text to Speech, Text to Music), then the four curated models. No app screenshots. No integration test.
- Never mention tests, fixtures, agent actions, or that a screenshot “was written by” a test.
- Do not show repo paths (`desktop/media/…`, `agent-test-…`) in prose. File names in `src=` are fine.

# Test tree

Generate (`05`) writes the still and leaves the project. Audio to Video (`06`) opens that same project and that same still, then tears down.

- Re-running generate means re-running audio-to-video and refreshing Help media on both pages.
- Do not generate a new still in `06`. Do not sweep the journey project at the end of `05`.
- `06` screenshots in order on the first pass: audio-only timeline (`generate: false`, no video clip), then the filled A2V form (`form: true`), then the finished clip.
